{"id":213,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The berries stored in its vaselike shell eventually become a thick, pulpy juice."},{"games":["Sword","Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It stores berries inside its shell. To avoid attacks, it hides beneath rocks and remains completely still."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Shuckle quietly hides itself under rocks, keeping its body concealed inside its hard shell while eating berries it has stored away. The berries mix with its body fluids to become a juice."},{"games":["X"],"text":"The berries stored in its jar-like shell eventually become a thick, pulpy juice."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It stores berries in its shell. The berries eventually ferment to become delicious juices."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"The berries it stores in its vase-like shell decompose and become a gooey liquid."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A SHUCKLE hides under rocks, keeping its body concealed inside its shell while eating stored berries. The berries mix with its body fluids to become a juice."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"The fluid secreted by its toes carves holes in rocks for nesting and can be mixed with BERRIES to make a drink."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sturdy","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon cannot be knocked out by a single hit as long as its HP is full. One-hit KO moves will also fail to knock it out."},{"name":"Gluttony","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is holding a Berry to be eaten when its HP is low, it will instead eat the Berry when its HP drops to half or less."},{"name":"Contrary","hidden":true,"description":"Reverses any stat changes affecting the Pokémon so that attempts to boost its stats instead lower them—and attempts to lower its stats will boost them."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"mountai